_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T09:53:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T09:53:09Z","body":"What change caused the issue? Is it a regression in 4.6?\nIf so, and the proposed fix doesn't fully solve the problem, we should probably revert what caused the regression.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3789396421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3790234816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114997#issuecomment-3790234816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114997","id":3790234816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7h6mTA","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T13:26:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T13:26:37Z","body":"Viewport orbit snapping was added in 4.6 with this PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111509\n\nI just created another PR, that combined with the PR linked to this issue will address the regression: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115298","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3790234816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804284963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114997#issuecomment-3804284963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114997","id":3804284963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iwMgj","user":{"login":"Rokojori","id":208519335,"node_id":"U_kgDODG3Apw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208519335?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori","html_url":"https://github.com/Rokojori","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rokojori/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T10:11:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T10:11:45Z","body":"This clashes with any setup that is not using the abritory labelled preset named \"Godot\" and makes it basically unusable for them.\n\nI don't know why this is such a big deal. There are assignable commands, why are there hard coded bindings?\n\nAnd can you please don't label presets in a way, where it feels like I'm not a \"REAL\" user when I use a setting different than the contributor's personal preference?\n\n \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804284963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804300731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114997#issuecomment-3804300731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114997","id":3804300731,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iwQW7","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T10:14:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T10:14:46Z","body":"@Rokojori The naming of the presets goes back to at least 3.x and is a reference to specific 3d authoring software","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804300731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805942452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114997#issuecomment-3805942452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114997","id":3805942452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i2hK0","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T15:43:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T15:45:00Z","body":"@Rokojori Please avoid commenting on GitHub in an accusatory tone, it's not very constructive.\n\nThis is a bug and will be fixed. It was just reported too late in the release cycle to be a release blocker, as it affects a non-default config, and there is a workaround (reassign the orbit snapping shortcut). And the fixes, while probably correct, haven't been approved yet by maintainers and given how brittle that code is, the potential for regression was significant enough to not risk merging them days before the 4.6-stable release. It will be fixed in 4.6.1-stable once we have had time to review and validate the fixes.\n\nThe names of the navigation schemes are indeed related to the 3D authoring software that used them (also arbitrary \"personal preferences\" of their authors), so I don't see a problem with the default one being named \"Godot\" in the Godot application.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805942452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3809949277","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114997#issuecomment-3809949277","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114997","id":3809949277,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jFzZd","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T09:04:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T09:04:49Z","body":"Yeah, the names may need to be updated as Modo was discontinued, people won't know what it is very soon. \"Godot\" could just be renamed \"Default\". \n\nIdeally, the 3 schemes (or is it 4?) would be supported equally so that users not using the default don't feel less important. That would mean that as part of the PR reviewing process, we would test compatibility issues with the supported schemes. Especially, when a contributor uses modifier keys in their PR.\n\nIf we can't offer this level of support (e.g. we think we can only review 1 scheme by PR) then we could explicitly tag the non-reviewed schemes as experimental, so that users know there will be less support there; that is we don't review compatibility issues upstream.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3809949277/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3816531863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114997#issuecomment-3816531863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114997","id":3816531863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7je6eX","user":{"login":"Rokojori"